1. comparison or three questions    =>Binary Search → Boundary Search (Lower Bound / Upper Bound / Floor)

Question	                                        Kya find karna hai?	                                Pattern
1. GFG Floor in Sorted Array	                    Target se chhota ya equal, sabse bada element	    Floor
2. LC 35 Search Insert Position	                    Target se bada ya equal, first position	            Lower Bound
3. LC 744 Smallest Letter Greater Than Target	    Target se strictly bada, first element	            Upper Bound


Examples:
arr = [1, 3, 5, 7, 9]
target = 5

1. Floor in Sorted Array (GFG)
Target se chhota ya equal sabse bada element.
Floor = greatest element ≤ target
Answer = 5

2. Search Insert Position (LC 35)
Target se bada ya equal, first position.
Lower Bound = first element ≥ target
Answer = index 2

3. Smallest Letter Greater Than Target (LC 744)
Target se strictly bada, first element.
Upper Bound = first element > target
Answer = 7

